p.src:
The field equation is now $\boxed{
 R_{\mu\nu}-\frac12 g_{\mu\nu}R
 =
 8\pi G\,T_{\mu\nu}
 }.$ The left-hand side is geometric; the right-hand side describes matter, radiation, and their flows. Their covariant divergences vanish together.

