p.src:
Define $T=g^{\mu\nu}T_{\mu\nu}.$ Taking the trace of Equation  gives $\begin{aligned}
 R-\frac12(4)R&=8\pi G\,T,\\
 -R&=8\pi G\,T,\end{aligned}$ so $\boxed{R=-8\pi G\,T}.$ Substitution back into the field equation yields $\boxed{
 R_{\mu\nu}
 =
 8\pi G
 \left(
 T_{\mu\nu}-\frac12g_{\mu\nu}T
 \right)
 }.$

